NOTE ON SCOPE

The MIT license above covers the source code in this repository.

It does NOT cover:

  * The training datasets. These are third-party works from Roboflow Universe
    under CC BY 4.0 and Public Domain terms. They are not redistributed here;
    `python -m ml.ingest` downloads them from source. Per-dataset licenses and
    attributions are in DATA_SOURCES.md.

  * Trained model weights, if distributed. Weights are derived from CC BY 4.0
    datasets, so any distribution should carry the attributions listed in
    DATA_SOURCES.md.

  * Ultralytics YOLO11, which is licensed AGPL-3.0. This project depends on it
    but does not vendor it. Anyone distributing a combined or hosted work built
    on Ultralytics should review AGPL-3.0 obligations, or obtain an Ultralytics
    commercial license.
